        "## SG — start here\n\nTwo halves. Run one at a time.\n\n**Publish.** Run it as it is: the test card appears in the Preview on the right and nothing is sent\nanywhere. To create a Version, pick a **project** and a **link** on the Publish node and Run again.\nThe panel names the Version before you press anything. Ctrl-B mutes a node if you want it out of\nthe way.\n\n**Load.** Pick the same project and link on the Load node, then Run. It reads back the Version you\njust made and shows it below.\n\nNo model and no download. **Create Published Files** is off, so nothing is written to disk; turn it\non once your profile names a storage."
